<title>BELGIUM: Solvay merges alkalis, peroxygens sectors.</title>
<headline>Solvay merges alkalis, peroxygens sectors.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals and drugs group Solvay said on Thursday that it would combine its alkalis and peroxygens sectors into a chemicals sector from July 1 to take advantage of market synergies.</p>
<p>The sector would be headed by Jean Christiaens, currently general manager of the alkalis sector, the company told the annual general shareholders meeting.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
